<view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="brand">LureCast.</view><button size="mini" bindtap="locations">{{place.name}} ⌄</button></view><view class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CAST STARTS HERE</view><view class="title">等一场好潮，<text class="accent">去野。</text></view><view class="sub">未来15天天气 · 真实站点潮表 · 当地鱼种条件参考</view><scroll-view class="dates" scroll-x><view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="date" class="day {{item.selected?'selected':''}}" bindtap="selectDate" data-date="{{item.date}}"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="small">{{item.temperature}}</text></view></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sub">正在获取天气…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card"><view class="sub">{{error}}</view><button bindtap="retry">重新获取天气</button></view><button class="primary" bindtap="fish">查看鱼种钓鱼指数</button><view class="row"><button bindtap="tides">选择官方潮汐站点</button><button bindtap="addPlan">加入出钓计划</button></view><view class="metrics"><view class="card metric" wx:for="{{metrics}}" wx:key="name"><view class="sub">{{item.name}}</view><view class="value">{{item.value}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.note}}</view></view></view><view class="sub">{{date}} · 北京时间 · 缺失显示 —<text wx:if="{{updated}}"> · 获取于 {{updated}}</text></view><view class="sub">天气：Open-Meteo · CC BY 4.0 · 免费接口仅限非商业使用</view><button bindtap="about">数据来源与隐私说明</button></view>
